#: manager.ts:237
msgid "Its menus, shortcuts, windows and effects are removed at once; open media keeps playing. A development-loaded plugin stays disabled only for this run."
msgstr "它的菜单、快捷键、窗口与处理效果会立即撤销，打开的媒体继续播放。开发加载的插件只在本次运行内停用。"

#: manager.ts:237
msgid "Its menus, shortcuts, windows and effects (such as the equalizer, filters, subtitle style) are removed at once; open media keeps playing. It stays disabled after Vestra Player restarts; you can enable it here at any time."
msgstr "它的菜单、快捷键、窗口与处理效果（如均衡器、滤镜、字幕样式）会立即撤销，打开的媒体继续播放。重启 Vestra Player 后仍保持停用，可随时在这里启用。"

